Welcome:
	TaskPaper lines are projects, tasks or notes.
	- A task for today @today
	- A finished task @done(2026-10-01)
	Nested project:
		- Sub task @due(2026-10-10) @priority(1)
		- Another @note(value with \(parens\))

Errands: @home
	- Buy milk
	- Call Alice @waiting

Searches:
	Today @search(@today and not @done)
	Mine @search(\(a or b\) and not @done)
Archive:
	- Old task @done(2026-09-01) @project(Welcome / Nested project)
